<title>POLAND: POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 200 MLN 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH C.BANK OFFERS PLN 200 MLN 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered 200 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills on Friday, the</p>
<p>central bank said.</p>
<p>Full details below.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - May 16, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered - February 13, 1998</p>
<p>-- Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
